  "storyId": "1stact_level_a001_05_beg",
  "groupId": "1stact",
  "stageId": "a001_05",
  "title": "各抒己见",
  "storyCode": "GT-5",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_05_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "aa81bb9e4d4680141a86ebdcc82f10dfc2998773fe5ed55d167c902e0fc16a5d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第五关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "果然只有这个洞口可以出入，对吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "嗯。洞窟里面虽然有很多岔路，不过村里的大人带我来过几次，包括继任村长那天......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "......那个，不知道是不是我的错觉，那边，森林里面的喊声是不是更多了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "再拖延下去，情况只会更加恶化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "可萝尔，你知道山洞中的道路，我想让你马上进入洞窟，沿着暗道去提前拿到宝藏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "欸？你是要......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "我留在这个洞口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "不行！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "唉？可萝尔......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "你要一个人面对那么多的赏金猎人？太危险了！你，你这样会——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "如果不能帮你拿到宝藏，我既对不起村子，也辜负了你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "......可我不想失去你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "这里，这里也不是你该逞英雄的场合......！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "逞英雄又有什么不好呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "“即便心脏被敌寇的利刃刺穿，国王的骑兵亦不解下手中长枪。”",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "我绝不会在这里逃走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "格拉尼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "而且可萝尔，这不只是我一个人的战斗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "你也有你的战斗。也许你会因此遭遇危险，但只要能让这片土地回归平静……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "我们就必须去做这些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "宝藏那边就交给你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "可是......我一个人的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "宝藏......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "相信我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "何况，我一定会照顾好你的。在广场救下你之后我就已经下定决心，绝不会让任何人再从你这夺走什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "哪怕只是根头发。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "......你明明还是一个小孩子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "我可不是什么......我只是个子不高而已啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "呵呵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "text": "......嗯，我会和你一起行动的，格拉尼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "该死的白面具，怎么连你们都要来碍事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "text": "乌合之众。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动",
      "text": "没有资格和我们争夺宝藏。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "啊？你在说什么？这里早就被我们占下来了，你们还是夹着尾巴滚蛋吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "（这个角度能恰好看到南面的战场，看来赏金猎人和整合运动已经展开了混战。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "（接下来，无论哪一方的人接近这个洞口，我只要——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "趁他们在那边打成一团，我们冲进去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "等等，有个小个子站在那里！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "text": "没人可以通过这里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "咕哇——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "text": "你、你——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "你们，全都给我让开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斯卡蒂",
      "text": "我现在心情很差。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
